---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { SUPPORT_EMAIL, SITE_NAME } from '../lib/site';
---
<Legal
  pageTitle={`Terms of Service | ${SITE_NAME}`}
  heading="Terms of Service"
  description={`The terms for using ${SITE_NAME} products responsibly, including disclaimers and account responsibilities.`}
>
  <p>
    By using the software and services published on this site (including Toolport, Toolport Teams, and the
    Omarchy plugins), you agree to use them lawfully and responsibly. These are tools to help you work your own
    way; they are provided to improve your workflows, not to make decisions for you.
  </p>

  <h2>No professional advice</h2>
  <p>
    The software on this site organizes information and automates developer and desktop tasks. It does not
    provide tax, legal, accounting, financial, or safety advice. You remain responsible for reviewing any output
    before relying on it or sending it to others.
  </p>

  <h2>Account responsibility</h2>
  <p>
    You are responsible for maintaining access to your account and for the accuracy of information you enter,
    upload, or approve.
  </p>

  <h2>Service changes</h2>
  <p>I may update features, pricing, policies, and product availability over time.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`}>{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
</Legal>
